{"seq":3,"slug":"ipc-tradeoffs","title":"IPC 选型权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/foundations/ipc-tradeoffs","wordCount":1407,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ipc-选型权衡\">IPC 选型权衡</h1><p>真实工程里，「该用哪种 IPC」很少有唯一答案，但几乎总有明显更差的答案。把共享内存用在两个偶尔交换几字节状态的进程上，是过度设计；用管道去搬运每秒数 GB 的视频帧，是把拷贝开销当税交。这一篇不引入任何新机制，而是把全 hub 的机制摆在同一张权衡台上，给出一套能在五分钟内做出合理决策的框架，并充当整个 hub 的导航枢纽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>选型本质是在若干相互冲突的约束之间找平衡点。最关键的四个约束是：数据规模（几字节还是几 GB）、延迟预算（微秒级还是毫秒级无所谓）、信任边界（同一用户的进程还是跨权限/跨容器）、以及可移植性要求（只跑 Linux 还是要兼顾其它 OS）。每一种机制都是这四维空间里的一个点，没有任何一个点能同时占据所有最优角。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Start[需要进程间通信] --&gt; Q1{只是通知/&lt;br/&gt;极少数据?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|是| Sig[信号 / eventfd]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|否| Q2{数据量大且&lt;br/&gt;延迟敏感?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| Shm[共享内存 + 同步]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{需要跨权限&lt;br/&gt;或传 fd?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| Uds[Unix 域套接字]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q4{要调用对方&lt;br/&gt;的方法?}&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|是| Rpc[本地 RPC / D-Bus]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|否| Pipe[管道 / 消息队列]\">flowchart TD\n    Start[需要进程间通信] --&gt; Q1{只是通知/&lt;br/&gt;极少数据?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|是| Sig[信号 / eventfd]\n    Q1 --&gt;|否| Q2{数据量大且&lt;br/&gt;延迟敏感?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| Shm[共享内存 + 同步]\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{需要跨权限&lt;br/&gt;或传 fd?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| Uds[Unix 域套接字]\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q4{要调用对方&lt;br/&gt;的方法?}\n    Q4 --&gt;|是| Rpc[本地 RPC / D-Bus]\n    Q4 --&gt;|否| Pipe[管道 / 消息队列]</pre><p>这张决策树不是教条，而是起点：它给出第一直觉，细节再用下面的对比表校正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全机制权衡对比\">全机制权衡对比</h2><p>把 hub 涉及的主要机制放在一起，按核心维度打分，能一眼看出各自的甜区。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>吞吐</th>\n<th>数据粒度</th>\n<th>跨权限</th>\n<th>可移植性</th>\n<th>主讲文档</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>纯通知</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>高（POSIX）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../message-based/signals\">信号</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管道 / FIFO</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>字节流</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td><a href=\"../message-based/pipes-fifos\">管道与命名管道</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息队列</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>离散消息</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td><a href=\"../message-based/message-queues-ipc\">消息队列</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享内存</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td><a href=\"../shared-memory/shared-memory\">共享内存</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存映射文件</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td><a href=\"../shared-memory/memory-mapped-files\">内存映射文件</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unix 域套接字</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>流/数据报</td>\n<td>强（带凭证）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td><a href=\"../networked/unix-domain-sockets\">Unix 域套接字</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地 RPC / D-Bus</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>方法调用</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td><a href=\"../networked/rpc-mechanisms\">本地 RPC</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>io_uring</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>低（仅 Linux）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../networked/modern-ipc\">现代 IPC</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意「跨权限」一列：共享内存与 io_uring 标弱，不是说不能用，而是说它们不自带身份验证，安全得靠外层把关；而域套接字内建凭证传递，天然适合信任边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟与吞吐的量化直觉\">延迟与吞吐的量化直觉</h2><p>权衡需要数量级感觉，否则容易凭印象误判。一次系统调用约数百纳秒（见<a href=\"process-isolation\">进程隔离</a>的陷入分析），一次内存拷贝的成本与数据量线性相关。把消息式单次传输建模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{msg}(N) = 2 t_{copy} N + 2 t_{syscall}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9305em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，共享内存建模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{shm}(N) = t_{sync}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，两者相等时的临界数据量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^* = \\frac{t_{sync} - 2 t_{syscall}}{2 t_{copy}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2935em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当实际数据量远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，同步开销主导，消息式反而更划算且更简单；远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，拷贝开销主导，共享内存优势压倒性。这个简单模型解释了为什么「小数据用管道、大数据用共享内存」是经验法则而非偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"被忽视的成本-复杂度与正确性\">被忽视的成本：复杂度与正确性</h2><p>性能表只讲了一半。共享内存把同步责任全部推给开发者，一个忘记加锁的写入就是难复现的数据竞争；<a href=\"../shared-memory/synchronization-primitives\">同步原语</a>的健壮性、死锁、持锁进程崩溃，每一项都是真实的工程负担。相比之下，管道天然串行、天然带流控，几乎不可能写出数据竞争。</p>\n<p>因此选型的隐藏维度是「正确性预算」：团队能投入多少精力保证并发正确。延迟敏感但团队并发经验有限时，用域套接字而非裸共享内存，往往是更优的整体决策——慢一点的代码远胜于偶尔损坏数据的代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"典型场景对照\">典型场景对照</h2><p>把框架落到具体场景能加深理解。Shell 管道连接命令，选管道，因为简单且天然适配字节流。容器运行时给容器递交一个已打开的 socket，选域套接字，因为只有它能传文件描述符。高频交易系统在两个进程间传递行情快照，选共享内存配无锁环形缓冲，因为延迟是一切。桌面应用查询系统服务（如蓝牙状态），选 D-Bus，因为它要的是「调用方法」而非「发字节」。高性能存储引擎处理海量异步 I/O，选 io_uring，因为它要消灭系统调用税。</p>\n<p>每个场景的「为什么」都能在前面的维度表里找到对应列。这正是这套框架的价值：把直觉变成可解释、可复核的决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把决策树写成代码\">把决策树写成代码</h2><p>决策框架可以固化成一段可读的伪逻辑，方便在 code review 时对照检查选型是否合理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def choose_ipc(data_size, latency_critical, cross_privilege, needs_method_call):&#10;    if data_size &lt;= TINY and not needs_method_call:&#10;        return &quot;信号 / eventfd&quot;          # 纯通知&#10;    if data_size &gt;= LARGE and latency_critical:&#10;        return &quot;共享内存 + 同步原语&quot;      # 零拷贝, 但要自管并发&#10;    if cross_privilege or needs_fd_passing:&#10;        return &quot;Unix 域套接字&quot;           # 凭证 + SCM_RIGHTS&#10;    if needs_method_call:&#10;        return &quot;本地 RPC / D-Bus&quot;        # 抽象 &gt; 性能&#10;    return &quot;管道 / 消息队列&quot;             # 简单可靠的默认\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> choose_ipc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_size, latency_critical, cross_privilege, needs_method_call):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TINY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> needs_method_call:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"信号 / eventfd\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 纯通知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LARGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latency_critical:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"共享内存 + 同步原语\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 零拷贝, 但要自管并发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cross_privilege </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> needs_fd_passing:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Unix 域套接字\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 凭证 + SCM_RIGHTS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> needs_method_call:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"本地 RPC / D-Bus\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 抽象 > 性能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"管道 / 消息队列\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # 简单可靠的默认</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段代码的价值不在于自动选型，而在于把「为什么选它」摊成可争论的条件分支——当有人质疑选型时，逐条核对这些判据，比凭感觉辩论高效得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>选型是在数据规模、延迟预算、信任边界、可移植性四个冲突约束间找平衡，无银弹。</li>\n<li>决策树给第一直觉，全机制对比表给精确校正，两者配合使用。</li>\n<li>临界数据量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 给出「小数据用消息式、大数据用共享内存」的量化依据。</li>\n<li>别只看性能：共享内存的「正确性预算」常是隐藏的决定性成本，团队并发能力有限时优先选自带同步与流控的机制。</li>\n<li>本篇是 hub 导航枢纽，每种机制的深入细节见上表所链接的主讲文档；机制全景图见 <a href=\"ipc-overview\">IPC 概览与分类</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IPC 选型权衡","id":"ipc-选型权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"全机制权衡对比","id":"全机制权衡对比"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟与吞吐的量化直觉","id":"延迟与吞吐的量化直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"被忽视的成本：复杂度与正确性","id":"被忽视的成本-复杂度与正确性"},{"level":2,"text":"典型场景对照","id":"典型场景对照"},{"level":2,"text":"把决策树写成代码","id":"把决策树写成代码"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"进程隔离与地址空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/foundations/process-isolation"},"next":{"title":"管道与命名管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/message-based/pipes-fifos"}}